WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:07.112
In 4,372, what is the value of the thousands digit? Let us think carefully. The digit

00:00:07.112 --> 00:00:12.296
in that place is worth 4,000. The answer is 4000. Great work!

00:00:13.117 --> 00:00:19.066
In 6,805, what is the value of the hundreds digit? Let us think carefully. The digit

00:00:19.066 --> 00:00:23.527
in that place is worth 800. The answer is 800. Great work!

00:00:24.367 --> 00:00:30.519
In 9,134, what is the value of the tens digit? Let us think carefully. The digit in

00:00:30.519 --> 00:00:34.500
that place is worth 30. The answer is 30. Great work!

00:00:35.367 --> 00:00:41.156
In 2,057, what is the value of the ones digit? Let us think carefully. The digit in

00:00:41.156 --> 00:00:44.903
that place is worth 7. The answer is 7. Great work!
